  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Utility Scale Solar Photovoltaic and Battery Storage Project in the Tashkent Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project objectives include increasing the supply of privately financed solar power generation to meet Uzbekistan&#x2019;s increasing energy demand while ensuring the stabilization of the grid. It will avoid grid congestion, regulate peak loads, and improve the efficiency and reliability of power supply to the national economy and the population of Tashkent and the Tashkent region. The project is expected to generate 470 million kWh per year of electricity from solar energy resources, enough to power more than 160,000 households.</narrative>
  </description>
